// Bows, crossbows and their ammunition (melee-and-ranged 4.5). Momentum comes from the launcher, not the archer's arm:
// M_milli = mass_g x v_mps x power_pm x 485 / 10,000, with drag v(d) = v0 x (1 - 1.2 d_m / 1000). A longbow bodkin leaves at 120.0 units,
// a crossbow quarrel at 132.4. Quivers: 24 arrows or 20 bolts; NPC bandits carry 12 (fight setup).
